@startuml MemberC_State_Finding
title Member C — State machine: Finding (REQ-C-01, UC-07)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Proposed : Specialist creates alert

Proposed --> EvidenceAttached : attachEvidence()\nlocator + payload present
Proposed --> Proposed : narrative added\n(cannot Confirm yet)

EvidenceAttached --> Confirmed : Practitioner.confirm()\n[evidence.locator != null]
EvidenceAttached --> Dismissed : Practitioner.dismiss(reason)
EvidenceAttached --> NeedsMoreInfo : Practitioner.requestMoreInfo()

NeedsMoreInfo --> EvidenceAttached : producing agent supplies\nadditional Evidence (UC-08)
NeedsMoreInfo --> Dismissed : Practitioner dismisses after rework

Confirmed --> IncludedInReport : ReviewReport.freeze()
Dismissed --> [*] : omitted or appendix only

IncludedInReport --> [*]

note right of EvidenceAttached
  AGR-02 gate: Confirm transition
  is guarded on evidence presence.
  LLM may phrase narrative but
  cannot move this state machine.
end note

@enduml
